Package: vtessera
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Opt-in compute marketplace — metering daemon
 Vtessera is a metering daemon for an opt-in compute marketplace.
 It samples local resource usage from /proc, produces signed usage
 receipts (Ed25519), and writes them to a state directory.
 .
 This package ships the core daemon (vtesserad).

Package: vtessera-node
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Opt-in compute marketplace — node HTTP server
 The node server exposes an HTTP API for AI agents to submit jobs,
 verify x402 payments, and retrieve signed receipts. Includes MCP
 (Model Context Protocol) tool interface.
 .
 This package ships vtessera-node and vtessera-mcp.

Package: vtessera-offer-index
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Opt-in compute marketplace — central offer index
 The offer index aggregates signed offers from provider nodes and
 serves them to AI agents. Supports heartbeats, claims, and
 STUN-reflexive candidate discovery.
 .
 This package ships vtessera-offer-index.

Package: vtessera-settle
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Opt-in compute marketplace — settlement tool
 Reads signed job receipts from the spool and writes settlement
 records. When wired to Solana, submits completion-fraction
 settlements against the on-chain escrow.
 .
 This package ships vtessera-settle.
